{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> agent/journal.md <<'EOF'\n\nIteration70/71 TimesFM full result PASSED:10/10 cells improve versus v9 bridge. September mean923.5471→922.1419(mean per-asset-0.1360%);October690.6868→689.3561(-0.1988%). This is a retained research candidate, not yet serving.\n\n## Iteration73 — temporal validation of TimesFM\n\nBudget63.90/100USD,14.5h remaining,normal. Keep the exact pretrained point-forecast25% blend and all settings fixed. Score the additional Sep23–30 period against sep_late_bridge and the causal July20–21/Aug20–21 periods against historical_bridge_1h, using pre-July seasonality,clock,event tables for both historical forecasts. Require the added-period mean and BOTH historical means to improve, with most cells favorable; no historical tuning if the criterion fails. Four CPU workers per study, with at most three workers in the sequential Chronos queue, total at most11. Full-window results are not interpreted as untouched-test evidence.\nEOF\nuv run python - <<'PY'\nimport subprocess,os,json\nfrom pathlib import Path\njobs=[]\nfor tag,days,ends,config in [('sep_late_timesfm_v9',8,['2026-10-01'],{'timesfm':True}),('historical_timesfm_v9',2,['2026-07-22','2026-08-22'],{'timesfm':True,'table':'seasonality_jul01.json','clock_table':'clock_jul01.json','event_table':'event_multipliers_jul01.json'})]:\n cmd=['uv','run','agent/run_suite.py','--tag',tag,'--model','candidate_v9_research','--config',json.dumps(config),'--cached-prompts','--prediction-dtype','float32','--days',str(days),'--ends',*ends,'--assets','BTC','ETH','SOL','XRP','HYPE','--formats','1h','--workers','4']\n log='agent/results/'+tag+'_suite.log';jobs.append({'cmd':cmd,'log':log})\n with open(log,'w') as f:p=subprocess.Popen(cmd,stdout=f,stderr=subprocess.STDOUT,start_new_session=True,env=dict(os.environ,OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS='1',OMP_NUM_THREADS='1',MKL_NUM_THREADS='1',TORCH_DISABLE_NATIVE_JIT='1'))\n print(tag,p.pid)\nPath('agent/queue_timesfm_validation.json').write_text(json.dumps(jobs,indent=2))\nPY\n git add agent/journal.md agent/queue_timesfm_validation.json agent/results/timesfm_v9_full agent/results/timesfm_v9_full_suite.log agent/results/chronos_adaptive_v8_full agent/results/chronos_adaptive_v8_full_suite.log\n git commit -m 'Record TimesFM full-window gains and register temporal validation'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
